# Author: Tigany Zarrouk (tiganyzarrouk@gmail.com)
#
# A dipole model read as a potential. Its block carries the same
# hyperparameters and the same sparse set as an energy block, so the arithmetic
# runs on it and returns a number; the flag is the only thing that says the
# number is a fitting artefact.
units           metal
atom_style      atomic
boundary        p p p
read_data       data/water6.data
pair_style      turbogap
pair_coeff      * * ${dgap} O H
run 0
